                                "sense_id": "be98ab87-3673-309f-9a91-f72258b816f4",
                                "text": "Of the few gaffings that I have seen attempted under water most have been either bad shots or failures. One sees the gut fouled, the fish torn, the fish lost, and the angler fume."
